OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage trams return 'hopeful'
OL,4,Afor light trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport bosses have said they are
OL,7,F"hopeful" that Blackpool's heritage
OL,8,Ftram tours can return in time for
OL,9,FOctober's Lightpool festival.
OL,11,FThe heritage tram service was suspended
OL,12,Fin December 2024 because it was hard to
OL,13,Frun them alongside the modern fleet.
OL,15,FIssues included safety and maintenance
OL,16,Fconflicts as well as a lack of depot
OL,17,Fspace after the Tramtown museum, which
OL,18,Fhoused the ageing fleet, was forced to
OL,19,Fclose in April as the building was
OL,20,Fdeemed unsafe.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40302
